    "chunk_text": "To middanwintra. Ostende nobis Domine. Her seg\u00f0 \u00feis halige godspel be \u00fe\u00e6re hean medomnesse \u00feisse halgan tide \u00fee nu onweard is, & us l\u00e6re\u00f0 For\u00feam se arf\u00e6sta f\u00e6der ne wolde l\u00e6tan his gesceaft forweor\u00f0an \u00fea\u00fee he to his agenre anlicnesse Swa sanctus Lucas se godspellere be \u00fean wrat & cw\u00e6\u00f0: In \u00fea tiid w\u00e6s mycel gemot gebannen fram \u00de\u00e6t gewrit w\u00e6s \u00e6rest ongunnen fram \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e gerefan \u00fee Syria hatte, \u00fe\u00e6s mannes nama w\u00e6s & \u00fea eodon ealle, anra gehwylc on his ceastre, \u00fe\u00e6tte hie onfengon \u00feam bebode \u00fee \u00fea gebannen w\u00e6s \u00dea ferde se eadga Ioseph fram Galilea, of \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre \u00fee Nazaret hatte, to Dauides ceastre sio is \u00dea hie \u00fea to Bethlem comon, w\u00e6ron \u00fea \u00f0a dagas gefylled \u00fe\u00e6t hio bearn cennan sceolde. & \u00fea cende hio sunu, hire frumbearn, on \u00feas niht \u00fee nu toniht w\u00e6s, & hio mid cla\u00f0um hine bewand & On \u00feam ilcan lande on \u00fea niht w\u00e6ron hyrdas w\u00e6ccende & hioldon \u00fea w\u00e6ccan \u00fe\u00e6re nihte ofer hiora \u00dea com him to dryhtnes engel & bi him gestod & hie ymbscan godcundes leohtes byrhto. \u00dea w\u00e6ron \u00fea hyrdas swi\u00f0e forhtiende mid mycle egsan & hie him swi\u00f0e ondredon. Se engel hie \u00fea frefrede & swa cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ne forhtia\u00f0 ge, ne eow ondr\u00e6da\u00fe. For\u00fey ic eow secge",
